#
# A state-reserved form of capital, as a truth, in Sutra
# (ninefold_model.h NF1): 4 <= form <= 7. form fits 9(1) and form + 1 must
# too, so a negative form, or one past 8, is not one of the nine and is
# refused, where Eve answers FALSE: held.
record reserved-form
  form: 9(1)
  edge: 9(1)
procedure
  compute edge = form + 1
  answer form >= 4 and form <= 7
